("v460", "scalar", "Sourcery creates software from explicit descriptions of meaning, behaviour and permitted change. People and AI propose; declared rules and accountable decisions govern what takes effect. The aim is automation people can understand, question and correct. This microsite illustrates the approach; it is not a general app-building service.")
